---
description: Arcane guidance adapter for YAML, prototypes, maps, workflows, and manifests
globs: **/*.yml,**/*.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---
Load yaml-and-schema plus the relevant prototype, map, resource, localization, or build skill. Generic YAML validity does not replace domain validation.

Read `.agents/rules/yaml-prototype-conventions.md`. Prototype entry order follows the `.Trauma.cs` suffix for partials: `Item`, `Container`, `Entity`, then the component family.

Apply the canonical marker rule by changed line count, not by YAML entry count. Append additions as one contiguous block where practical, and prefer `!Remove` or a partial over deleting an upstream entry. Never use `Trauma - ` or `<Trauma>` as authorship for our change; see `.cursor/rules/core.mdc`.
